WEBVTT

00:42.584 --> 00:43.710
All right, where do I begin?

00:45.211 --> 00:47.547
First, let me tell you
a little bit about myself.

00:47.630 --> 00:49.924
Pick up the pace,
we're out of time. Hurry!

00:51.259 --> 00:53.553
- Here.
- What's next?

00:53.636 --> 00:56.473
You can say I've always lived
a very professional life.

00:56.556 --> 00:58.600
- Pose for us.
- NJ over here!

01:00.310 --> 01:02.103
- NJ, I need a shot of you!
- Smile!

01:02.604 --> 01:03.730
That's right, pose for us.

01:03.813 --> 01:05.273
My life is glamorous

01:06.357 --> 01:08.276
with a lot of passion and devotion.

01:10.195 --> 01:11.780
All right, now forget about that.

01:12.489 --> 01:13.656
Wanna know the real me?

01:20.580 --> 01:21.748
EYE MAGIC
SHINE LIKE MAGIC

01:30.215 --> 01:33.051
Then we gotta talk about
someone else in my story.

01:36.971 --> 01:40.183
Here's a guy popping out of nowhere
like it was fate.

01:41.768 --> 01:43.978
Okay, maybe not so much.

01:49.526 --> 01:50.443
HAVER
NJ

01:51.653 --> 01:53.029
NJ PURCHASES A FIVE-STORY BUILDING

01:53.113 --> 01:55.949
Amazing. News travels really fast.

01:56.032 --> 01:59.077
- She bought another building?
- Never enough for that princess.

01:59.160 --> 02:02.122
Another article about you?
Whatever it is, just ignore it for now.

02:02.205 --> 02:04.916
Easier said than done,
you don't know what they wrote about me.

02:05.500 --> 02:08.294
So many ads nowadays,
you can barely see anything.

02:08.878 --> 02:09.838
Shit.

02:10.421 --> 02:11.965
Oh, come on.

02:12.632 --> 02:16.261
I guess it could've been big data
scientifically matching us up.

02:16.970 --> 02:18.096
They look kinda…

02:18.179 --> 02:20.807
GO-OH

02:21.516 --> 02:23.059
…strangely weird.

02:23.143 --> 02:23.977
GO-OH'S SOLO EXHIBITION

02:24.060 --> 02:26.938
As it happened,
right after purchasing a building,

02:27.021 --> 02:30.441
I ended up going to an exhibit
of someone who only drew buildings.

02:32.193 --> 02:34.154
And that's where him and I met each other.

02:36.364 --> 02:40.118
I know it's crinkled and messy,
but it's clean.

02:41.411 --> 02:42.871
What's this for?

02:42.954 --> 02:44.455
Well, you're crying and…

02:51.796 --> 02:54.090
Oh, sorry, the layout is
a little confusing, but

02:54.174 --> 02:56.050
you can start over there,
it's a lot easier.

02:56.134 --> 02:57.886
Oh, is that so? Thank you.

03:06.144 --> 03:07.770
Thank you for that.

03:09.522 --> 03:10.857
I guess I look silly?

03:12.275 --> 03:15.069
Crying while staring blankly
at a drawing of a building.

03:15.862 --> 03:17.780
Mm… Sounds pretty normal.

03:18.489 --> 03:20.950
You ever cry over a drawing of a building?

03:21.034 --> 03:22.160
Uh…

03:23.286 --> 03:24.537
Exactly.

03:25.663 --> 03:27.540
Not really something a normal person does.

03:30.168 --> 03:31.127
Hmm…

03:32.837 --> 03:35.924
But still, feel free to come here
and cry whenever you want.

03:37.342 --> 03:40.178
If you want, I'll cry with you
so it's not too weird.

03:45.725 --> 03:48.144
One of the worst
pick-up lines I've ever heard.

03:48.228 --> 03:49.812
I was trying to make you feel better.

03:49.896 --> 03:52.815
You make it a habit, comforting strangers?

03:52.899 --> 03:57.153
Uh, it doesn't feel like you're
a stranger, I see you a lot on TV.

03:57.237 --> 03:58.780
So it kinda feels like I already know you.

03:58.863 --> 04:00.198
I'm a big fan of yours.

04:01.491 --> 04:03.326
Bro! I need you to…

04:08.331 --> 04:09.332
Yo…

04:10.541 --> 04:12.919
Hey, bro, where are you?
You over here?

04:13.002 --> 04:14.379
Yo!

04:14.462 --> 04:17.257
Something smelled kinda fishy,
so I had to get to the bottom of it.

04:17.340 --> 04:19.133
Are you part of the staff here?

04:19.217 --> 04:21.386
Oh, no. I'm just a visitor.

04:21.469 --> 04:23.346
Are you familiar with the artist?

04:23.429 --> 04:25.056
Oh, no. Just a visitor.

04:25.139 --> 04:27.433
I'm interested in buying this.
How much you want for it?

04:27.517 --> 04:28.643
It's ten million…

04:31.062 --> 04:33.147
I don't wanna guess, I'm just a visitor.

04:33.231 --> 04:34.732
You can go there and ask,
maybe they'd know.

04:34.816 --> 04:37.360
Guess is not just the drawings
that are strange.

04:37.443 --> 04:38.987
- Huh?
- What?

04:39.070 --> 04:41.739
Oh, nothing.
So where do I ask about buying it again?

04:41.823 --> 04:45.326
I don't want you putting a single
scratch on it. Please be careful with it.

04:45.410 --> 04:48.538
GO-OH'S SOLO EXHIBITION

04:48.621 --> 04:51.708
Like I said,
I was gonna get to the bottom of it.

04:51.791 --> 04:53.251
May I ask for your phone, please?

04:53.334 --> 04:55.420
- I am a busy woman, but still…
- What?

04:55.503 --> 04:57.297
So if I ever get bored
of that drawing of yours,

04:57.380 --> 04:58.715
I can just buy another.

04:58.798 --> 05:00.049
Yeah, but I said it wasn't me.

05:00.133 --> 05:01.134
Oh, really?

05:01.634 --> 05:04.053
- I think I should get a refund then.
- Uh.

05:07.181 --> 05:09.267
Please don't tell anyone.

05:09.350 --> 05:12.103
This, now this was fun.

05:14.856 --> 05:18.359
This is my number.
Not a lot of people have it.

05:18.443 --> 05:21.696
Not a lot of people have my number either.
I don't have much friends.

05:23.573 --> 05:25.950
Now, I wanna make myself
perfectly clear…

05:26.034 --> 05:28.828
Anyway, I'll just give you a call later.

05:28.911 --> 05:31.247
ARTIST GO-OH

05:31.331 --> 05:33.875
…this isn't something
that I would normally do…

05:33.958 --> 05:35.293
- Sure.
- …that much.

05:35.376 --> 05:37.128
Wonder how long
this one will last.

05:37.211 --> 05:39.339
There's absolutely
no information about him.

05:39.422 --> 05:41.341
Did they ever finish
that diagnosis on your brain?

05:41.424 --> 05:42.258
Yes.

05:42.967 --> 05:44.927
Hmm, I'm just a romantic.

05:45.011 --> 05:46.763
Hmm, I think you mean lunatic.

05:46.846 --> 05:49.349
You're interested for one or two months
and then act all cold after.

05:49.432 --> 05:52.477
Every individual is unique,
and we all have our own ways.

05:53.102 --> 05:56.105
There you have it,
that's basically how our story began,

05:56.689 --> 06:00.026
turns out, he was more interesting
than I initially thought.

06:00.109 --> 06:01.736
And I mean a whole lot more.

06:06.783 --> 06:09.160
This caused a bit of a problem for me.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.956
Mr. Choi, what you doing?

06:14.040 --> 06:15.958
Prepping some beansprouts.

06:16.042 --> 06:18.086
God, it's really
scorching out there today.

06:18.169 --> 06:19.170
What you doing right now?

06:19.253 --> 06:21.964
Doing some weeding.
Feels like my hair is on fire.

06:22.048 --> 06:23.883
Gave a really good performance today.

06:23.966 --> 06:26.094
Why aren't you watching?
What are you so busy doing?

06:26.177 --> 06:29.555
I'm eating right now.
I can just pay the 1500 and rewatch it.

06:33.768 --> 06:37.688
Mr. Choi, I know it's late,
but I hope you can answer this question.

06:38.731 --> 06:39.857
What you doing right now?

06:39.941 --> 06:43.194
I seriously thought that he would just
pop into my head every now and then.

06:43.277 --> 06:44.862
Who? That person again?

06:52.286 --> 06:53.329
Choi Ung!

06:53.413 --> 06:55.289
So I wanna find out for myself

06:55.915 --> 06:57.834
is this just another one of those

06:57.917 --> 06:59.919
- short-lived feelings fleeting?
- Oh!

07:00.002 --> 07:01.921
Or will this one be different?

07:02.547 --> 07:03.673
And you know what?

07:04.298 --> 07:06.467
I don't think it'll take long to find out.

07:06.551 --> 07:13.558
EPISODE 10
HELLO, MY SOUL MATE

07:21.190 --> 07:22.400
What are you two doing?

07:30.533 --> 07:31.868
Uh…

07:31.951 --> 07:35.246
Know what this is?
It's our first day anniversary!

07:37.081 --> 07:40.209
I mean as friends, as friends.
Wow, a day already?

07:40.751 --> 07:41.669
Time flies.

07:43.171 --> 07:45.298
So are you doing a documentary or a skit?

07:47.800 --> 07:49.594
Well, what are you
even doing here at this hour?

07:49.677 --> 07:51.095
You didn't text or call.

07:51.179 --> 07:52.472
Actually, you didn't pick up.

07:53.806 --> 07:56.851
Seeing you together late at night
looking like this…

07:56.934 --> 07:58.478
seems strange is you ask me.

07:58.561 --> 08:00.688
Um, I know. I get that
this looks a little weird,

08:00.771 --> 08:02.482
- and you could probably take this--
- Not at all.

08:02.565 --> 08:05.610
You probably got tired of arguing
and decided to bury the hatchet.

08:05.693 --> 08:07.820
- Exactly. What you said. Exactly.
- Hmm.

08:24.587 --> 08:26.631
- I'm sleeping over.
- What?

08:27.256 --> 08:29.008
Hey. My house look
like a motel or something?

08:29.091 --> 08:31.511
Why has everyone
been bunking up here lately?

08:31.594 --> 08:32.929
Why? Who else slept here?

08:34.096 --> 08:37.225
Uh… Eun-ho. You know that punk.

08:37.308 --> 08:38.226
Shit.

08:44.565 --> 08:46.609
Are you guys gonna just stand there?

08:46.692 --> 08:50.112
Oh, it's getting late,
so I should get going now.

08:50.196 --> 08:51.781
Wait. What about the chicken?

08:51.864 --> 08:54.492
- What? Sad to see me go?
- In your dreams.

08:54.575 --> 08:56.077
Besides, late-night snacks are unhealthy.

08:56.160 --> 08:57.662
Says the one who ordered it.

08:57.745 --> 08:59.622
All right, I'm off now. You two have fun.

08:59.705 --> 09:01.791
Yeon-su, just call a cab. It's dark.

09:01.874 --> 09:03.042
It's okay. I'll just walk.

09:03.125 --> 09:05.753
- I ordered some chicken--
- Hey. Just go.

09:10.716 --> 09:12.593
Okay, okay, no need to push me.

09:12.677 --> 09:16.639
If you go now you can still catch the bus.
Take number four. Don't walk home.

09:41.706 --> 09:42.957
What?

09:45.167 --> 09:46.127
Nothing.

09:51.257 --> 09:53.467
Finally, a little peace.

09:55.428 --> 09:57.888
It'd be great
if a certain someone also left.

09:57.972 --> 09:59.890
No need to get your panties in a bunch.

10:00.474 --> 10:02.101
- You eat yet?
- Hmm, I did.

10:02.810 --> 10:04.770
Ooh. Chicken will be here soon.

10:07.273 --> 10:09.150
Did you order some beer with that?

10:11.527 --> 10:12.486
Mm-hmm.

10:40.097 --> 10:41.390
Oh, God, you startled me.

10:41.474 --> 10:43.643
I almost got a heart attack, grandma!

10:43.726 --> 10:46.646
You little brat.
Do you know what time it is?

10:46.729 --> 10:49.649
So what? I always come home late.
I come home around this time--

10:49.732 --> 10:52.068
You're late by about 24 hours.

10:52.151 --> 10:54.695
I told you I'd be sleeping over
at my friend's house.

10:54.779 --> 10:56.697
I'm not a kid anymore. Take it easy.

10:56.781 --> 10:59.617
I always do this, don't tell me
this is why you're still up this late.

10:59.700 --> 11:01.494
Nice try.
You don't have any friends, you liar.

11:01.577 --> 11:04.914
What? Well, you don't have to hurt
your granddaughter's feelings like that.

11:04.997 --> 11:06.540
Where'd you stay over? Huh?

11:07.458 --> 11:10.044
I slept at Sol-i's.
You know I always do that.

11:10.127 --> 11:12.922
Hey, Yeon-su. Long time no see.
How's everything?

11:14.382 --> 11:16.092
When did you get… Why are you here?

11:16.175 --> 11:18.552
You little wench. How dare you lie to me?

11:18.636 --> 11:21.263
Tell me the truth.
Where did you sleep, you hussy?

11:21.347 --> 11:23.974
Leave it to me, grandma,
I'll interrogate the suspect.

11:24.058 --> 11:26.352
It's getting late. Go to bed. Go on.

11:26.435 --> 11:28.729
She's seeing some guy,
you can bet on that.

11:28.813 --> 11:30.606
- Okay, but that's good news.
- Of course it is.

11:30.690 --> 11:33.734
- Then why'd you slap her?
- Because I'm curious about whoever it is.

11:33.818 --> 11:35.319
Find out. I wanna know about it.

11:35.403 --> 11:37.863
You know I can hear you guys, right?

11:37.947 --> 11:40.574
Can you really? Let's go in.

11:42.076 --> 11:44.620
You have the right
to remain silent, young lady.

11:49.917 --> 11:51.210
What are you doing in my house?

11:51.293 --> 11:53.337
I bumped into your grandma in the alley.

11:53.921 --> 11:56.841
Funnily enough, she thought
you were sleeping over at my place.

11:56.924 --> 12:00.302
Should have told me about it before
so I could have backed up your lies.

12:00.386 --> 12:01.762
I didn't lie to anyone.

12:03.055 --> 12:05.099
How dare you say that to me.

12:05.182 --> 12:07.101
- What kind of friend do you think I--
- Choi Ung.

12:07.184 --> 12:08.769
I slept over at Ung's place.

12:08.853 --> 12:10.479
Yeah, I figured that.

12:10.563 --> 12:13.023
He said he wants to try
being friends for a change.

12:13.607 --> 12:14.692
What?

12:14.775 --> 12:17.653
That's right. He wants us to be friends.

12:19.238 --> 12:21.741
Nice to see you two still being boneheads.

12:22.992 --> 12:25.578
It's weird.
This is all a bit weird, right?

12:25.661 --> 12:27.955
Hey. Friend or not,
he doesn't deserve you.

12:28.038 --> 12:29.331
What's his deal anyway?

12:33.085 --> 12:35.254
And then? What did you say?

12:35.337 --> 12:36.881
Did you say okay?

12:38.174 --> 12:39.925
- Just for now.
- Ooh.

12:40.009 --> 12:41.469
Just for now?

12:42.887 --> 12:45.222
Then what? What's your plan?

12:46.223 --> 12:50.770
That plan is, I'm gonna figure out
how he really feels while being friends.

12:51.687 --> 12:53.314
I'm going to make him admit to it.

12:53.898 --> 12:56.484
What kind of a confession exactly.

12:57.902 --> 13:02.156
Yeon-su, this isn't a crime movie.
It's romance.

13:02.239 --> 13:04.325
He's not some perp you're trying to catch.

13:04.408 --> 13:06.619
He's basically your secret crush.

13:07.411 --> 13:08.329
My…

13:09.955 --> 13:13.375
No! I don't have a crush on him.
Don't be dumb. There's no secret.

13:13.459 --> 13:15.127
So what's all this then?

13:16.212 --> 13:18.964
I just… I just wanna know
what's on his mind

13:19.048 --> 13:20.674
so no one gets the wrong idea.

13:21.258 --> 13:23.677
You're curious
about his innermost thoughts

13:23.761 --> 13:25.721
because you want him to feel the same way.

13:26.305 --> 13:29.642
Don't hide it, darling. That's what
having a secret crush feels like.

13:31.644 --> 13:33.354
Go to bed. Stop thinking about him.

13:33.437 --> 13:35.940
I never said I was thinking about him.
Don't be ridiculous.

13:36.023 --> 13:37.066
Secret crushes.

13:37.149 --> 13:38.734
I've had a few myself.

13:39.318 --> 13:41.028
If you have any questions, ask away!

13:41.111 --> 13:42.780
I don't have a crush on him!

13:44.323 --> 13:47.409
Interesting, so you're saying that
it's a lot more serious than I thought?

13:47.493 --> 13:48.911
- Looks like the flame never went out.
- It's not like that.

13:48.994 --> 13:50.996
Shut your stupid mouth!

13:51.080 --> 13:53.332
Wow, that'll set you on fire.

13:54.708 --> 13:56.710
You can barely contain yourself
when I mention him--

13:56.794 --> 13:58.128
I said, that's not true!

14:08.681 --> 14:11.100
Hurry up and get over here!

14:14.478 --> 14:15.688
- It's here?
- Yep.

14:28.826 --> 14:29.743
Mm…

14:45.342 --> 14:47.219
So how many shoots do we have left?

14:48.095 --> 14:50.055
Just three. Wrapping up next week.

14:51.015 --> 14:54.226
How's the whole thing going?
Not exactly like you planned?

14:54.310 --> 14:56.812
Well, since you're aware of that,
maybe you'd like to take

14:56.896 --> 14:58.606
a little bit more initiative
on things, huh?

14:58.689 --> 15:00.149
Maybe you can stop running away.

15:00.232 --> 15:01.233
Hmm.

15:11.785 --> 15:14.204
So what's with that look
you've been giving me lately, huh?

15:15.039 --> 15:16.790
Yo. Tell me what's on your mind.

15:16.874 --> 15:20.002
Don't worry, if it's all bullshit anyway,
I'll filter it out myself.

15:21.420 --> 15:23.589
I have been meaning to ask you something.

15:25.257 --> 15:26.383
But never mind.

15:26.967 --> 15:28.093
Whatever, dude.

15:28.177 --> 15:29.345
I get to think however I want.

15:30.763 --> 15:32.431
Son of a bitch.

15:32.514 --> 15:35.142
I appreciate the creative way
of being annoying you've achieved.

15:42.483 --> 15:45.778
What? Is there something
going on with you?

15:47.655 --> 15:49.073
I mean you're…

15:49.156 --> 15:52.493
You're not a drinker,
and suddenly, you wanna drink. Also…

15:53.577 --> 15:55.245
You haven't slept here in ages, dude.

15:56.121 --> 15:59.708
I just… I don't feel like going home.

16:04.463 --> 16:05.464
Why?

16:06.090 --> 16:08.133
You get nervous
whenever big bro sleeps over?

16:08.217 --> 16:11.345
Are you drunk? Wash up and go to bed.

16:11.428 --> 16:13.013
And by the way,

16:13.555 --> 16:16.183
it has been ages
since we've had some alone time, huh?

16:16.725 --> 16:18.644
Ungie, wanna sleep together?

16:20.396 --> 16:24.108
Oh, God. If you ever wondered, this is why
I don't like drinking with lightweights.

16:24.191 --> 16:25.442
Sleeping already?

16:25.526 --> 16:27.945
Nah, I'm going to work a bit
before that. Go to sleep.

16:28.028 --> 16:30.030
Who the hell works after drinking?

16:30.656 --> 16:32.866
- Jesus. Shut up.
- Hey, no, don't go yet!

16:33.617 --> 16:34.952
I'm not sleepy.

16:36.870 --> 16:38.038
Here.

16:39.164 --> 16:41.083
While I'm still being nice,
just go to sleep.

16:41.166 --> 16:43.460
Or else I'm gonna kick you out.
Good night.

17:34.803 --> 17:36.972
The camera is ready to go.
Are you good?

17:38.015 --> 17:39.224
You're here early.

17:41.518 --> 17:43.145
- How's the background?
- Good. Okay.

17:43.228 --> 17:46.565
Oh, and you can sit right there.
We'll start whenever you're ready.

17:54.990 --> 17:57.034
You left it there on purpose.

17:57.117 --> 18:00.245
No, I didn't.
I really did forget all about it.

18:01.622 --> 18:05.000
So your legit excuse for going back there
is that you left a pouch behind.

18:05.084 --> 18:07.294
Huh. Couldn't think
of anything better than that?

18:07.377 --> 18:09.213
I'm not making excuses, it's true.

18:09.296 --> 18:11.131
That pouch has always been
like a treasure to me.

18:11.215 --> 18:14.384
Fine. Makes perfect sense.
So let me get this straight,

18:14.468 --> 18:16.261
I literally begged you
to have lunch with me.

18:16.345 --> 18:19.389
But then, all of a sudden,
you gotta go back to you-know-who

18:19.473 --> 18:21.350
'cause you left your pouch over there.

18:21.433 --> 18:23.977
I wonder why.
Oh, can I guess, pretty please?

18:25.145 --> 18:26.730
Girl, you're as transparent as ever.

18:26.814 --> 18:28.899
That's the most obvious excuse
so you can go back there

18:28.982 --> 18:31.026
and have a lovely lunch date
with just the two of you.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.528
What? That's nuts.

18:32.611 --> 18:34.363
Yeah? Tell me I'm wrong.

18:35.239 --> 18:37.116
Wow. I'm impressed.

18:37.199 --> 18:38.408
How in the world did Ung manage

18:38.492 --> 18:40.494
to wrap you around
his little finger like this?

18:40.577 --> 18:42.412
For real, I'm genuinely curious.

18:43.622 --> 18:47.000
Oh, my God, everyone! This girl has fallen
head over heels for her crush.

18:47.084 --> 18:49.378
She's so caught up by her feelings
that's she's even left me

18:49.461 --> 18:50.629
to starve to death all by myself!

18:50.712 --> 18:53.632
Can you stop saying
that I have a crush on him?

18:53.715 --> 18:54.925
Have a nice day.

18:56.927 --> 18:58.679
I'm gonna have a blissful meal all alone.

18:58.762 --> 19:00.556
That's right, all by myself.

19:01.181 --> 19:02.432
Go be happy, Yeon-su.

19:03.225 --> 19:04.601
Good luck, Yeon-su.

19:28.250 --> 19:30.502
Hello, everyone.
I'm Choi Ung's friend, NJ…

19:32.087 --> 19:34.798
Can I use a fake name?
Because I didn't get permission yet.

19:34.882 --> 19:39.011
Can you blur out my face?
No, wait. I'll look like a criminal then.

19:40.220 --> 19:41.638
All right, let's roll.

19:42.347 --> 19:44.057
Oh.

19:48.353 --> 19:50.314
So what do you wanna know today?

19:50.397 --> 19:52.107
You want me to talk about Choi Ung?

19:56.028 --> 19:56.945
Mmm.

20:01.283 --> 20:03.160
- I remember now!
- Holy! what the…

20:03.869 --> 20:05.787
- Wow.
- What are you doing here?

20:05.871 --> 20:07.122
You went to that bar over there

20:07.206 --> 20:08.749
so you can steal the recipes
from their menu, remember?

20:08.832 --> 20:10.375
- Huh?
- Wow.

20:10.459 --> 20:13.045
What are you doing here? Do you work here?

20:13.128 --> 20:15.589
Yeah, sometimes. I help out
during the days that they're busy.

20:15.672 --> 20:18.592
Oh, I knew you looked familiar.
Something about you was bugging me.

20:19.301 --> 20:21.637
Tell me, are you doing
market research again?

20:21.720 --> 20:23.180
I don't do that.

20:24.223 --> 20:25.557
Are you close with the owner or something?

20:25.641 --> 20:27.768
Huh? Didn't you know?

20:27.851 --> 20:29.228
- What?
- Look at the name.

20:30.395 --> 20:33.023
- It says "With Ung."
- Hmm. So what?

20:35.108 --> 20:36.902
No way.

20:36.985 --> 20:40.405
Huh. How could you miss that?
Your shop's literally nearby.

20:40.489 --> 20:42.783
Ji-ung's parents run this restaurant?

20:42.866 --> 20:44.660
Wow. Crazy.

20:44.743 --> 20:46.286
His family is wealthy.

20:46.370 --> 20:47.663
No wonder.

20:47.746 --> 20:51.375
You ever consider that maybe it's
Choi Ung's parents who own this place?

20:51.458 --> 20:53.835
Right. Come on.
Ji-ung's the one who actually looks more--

20:53.919 --> 20:55.671
It's owned by Choi Ung's parents.

20:55.754 --> 20:57.714
In fact, they own
all the restaurants in this area.

20:59.383 --> 21:02.594
But you're correct, Ung doesn't exactly
look like he's from a wealthy family.

21:02.678 --> 21:05.013
But yeah, he was born
with a silver spoon in his mouth.

21:05.097 --> 21:06.556
I just got goosebumps.

21:08.350 --> 21:11.603
Looks like he finally has
one charming trait under his sleeve.

21:11.687 --> 21:14.356
Not bad, Yeon-su,
guess you are a cunning girl.

21:14.940 --> 21:17.859
- Why? What about Yeon-su?
- Hmm? Nothing.

21:17.943 --> 21:19.486
Are you sure that's all that you need?

21:19.569 --> 21:22.406
- I have much more I can tell you.
- No, this is more than enough.

21:22.489 --> 21:24.616
That's weird. I didn't know
they were filming today.

21:25.701 --> 21:27.995
Same here. I'm as surprised
as you are right now.

21:29.538 --> 21:31.039
What are you doing back here?

21:31.623 --> 21:34.626
Oh, I just left something at your place.

21:34.710 --> 21:36.086
Mr. Choi.

21:36.753 --> 21:38.338
Were you watching the whole time here?

21:38.422 --> 21:41.717
You shouldn't have.
It was supposed to be a surprise for you.

21:41.800 --> 21:43.802
That doesn't make sense.
Why would you do it at my place?

21:43.885 --> 21:47.764
Why? For convenience sake, of course.
We're gonna go on a date today.

21:47.848 --> 21:50.684
I wouldn't call it that.

21:50.767 --> 21:53.562
Are you Kook Yeon-su?
We've actually met, if you don't remember.

21:54.146 --> 21:55.022
Right.

21:55.105 --> 21:57.107
I enjoyed your documentary.

21:58.233 --> 22:01.069
- Mr. Kim, is it okay if I go?
- Sure.

22:01.153 --> 22:03.322
I'm famished.
You haven't eaten yet, have you?

22:03.405 --> 22:04.865
- Let's go and take care of that.
- Oh…

22:04.948 --> 22:07.075
Hey, wait. Ung!

22:07.159 --> 22:09.453
I… I left something at your place.

22:09.536 --> 22:11.872
I need to go and get it right now
if that's okay.

22:12.372 --> 22:13.874
Right now? What is it?

22:13.957 --> 22:16.418
It's something I need.
It's super precious to me.

22:16.501 --> 22:18.420
Fine, just look for it yourself.

22:18.503 --> 22:20.172
But that wouldn't be right,
it's your house.

22:20.255 --> 22:22.716
Um, so what? You're used to it.

22:22.799 --> 22:24.217
Uh, but still…

22:25.010 --> 22:26.345
I'll see you next time.

22:27.304 --> 22:29.056
Shall we? Where to?

22:33.143 --> 22:34.561
You good to film?

22:35.729 --> 22:37.564
What? Film what?

22:38.815 --> 22:40.692
- Thank you very much. Bye.
- Thank you as well.

22:42.110 --> 22:44.154
Hold on. Why did NJ do this?

22:44.237 --> 22:47.532
Beats me. She wanted to be interviewed
as Ung's friend apparently.

22:47.616 --> 22:48.867
His friend?

22:50.202 --> 22:52.537
He's suddenly
made a new friend, that guy.

22:56.541 --> 22:58.335
Let's eat. Snap out of it.

22:59.002 --> 23:01.254
We could've had
something fancier if you wanted.

23:01.338 --> 23:03.507
It's my treat as a way of thanking you.

23:03.590 --> 23:05.300
Well, I like this place.

23:05.384 --> 23:07.260
It's where I come to
whenever I have some free time.

23:08.178 --> 23:10.472
This must be
a famous restaurant or something.

23:10.555 --> 23:12.516
- I have a great view from here.
- Of what?

23:12.599 --> 23:14.643
Of my building. Right over there.

23:17.979 --> 23:19.147
Wow.

23:20.023 --> 23:22.943
- How much is that place?
- You mean back then or right now?

23:23.026 --> 23:24.903
How does it feel
to own a building like that?

23:25.821 --> 23:27.280
Do you mean back then or right now?

23:28.573 --> 23:31.118
Oh, you sounded
all cool and awesome just now.

23:31.201 --> 23:32.744
Yeah, I know.

23:33.370 --> 23:35.330
How does it feel to finally
see the building,

23:35.414 --> 23:36.873
the one I asked you to draw?

23:36.957 --> 23:39.459
Right. You see…

23:41.169 --> 23:44.005
I just think that
it's not the best idea to draw it for you.

23:44.089 --> 23:47.300
I'm afraid it'll kinda
taint your reputation and also--

23:47.384 --> 23:48.677
And also?

23:49.594 --> 23:53.348
I'm not really motivated to draw it,
to be honest with you.

23:55.600 --> 23:59.479
Oh, God. For real?
Even my buildings get rejected by you.

24:00.647 --> 24:02.774
That really hurt my feelings.

24:02.858 --> 24:04.568
That wasn't my intention, sorry.

24:04.651 --> 24:07.362
I'm just messing with you. I understand.

24:07.446 --> 24:09.906
Then don't we just
forget about that favor.

24:13.034 --> 24:15.287
I told you.
NJ comes here all the time.

24:15.370 --> 24:16.788
You were right.

24:17.372 --> 24:18.707
Hey, who's that guy
she's eating with?

24:19.291 --> 24:20.375
Probably her manager.

24:20.459 --> 24:23.753
You know, she's not as pretty
as I thought she'd be. Way too skinny.

24:24.754 --> 24:25.922
I agree.

24:26.006 --> 24:28.258
I think she got plastic surgery recently.

24:28.842 --> 24:29.968
- You see it, don't you?
- For sure.

24:30.051 --> 24:31.595
Let's take a photo. Quick.

24:31.678 --> 24:34.764
Let me. I have a better angle
from where I'm sitting.

24:37.767 --> 24:40.479
I'm so sorry, no photos, please.

24:41.188 --> 24:44.107
I was… we weren't taking a photo of you.

24:44.191 --> 24:46.193
We were just trying to take a selfie.

24:50.614 --> 24:54.075
Probably happens way too often.
It seemed like it.

24:54.159 --> 24:57.662
Actually, it never gets old.
But I pretend like it does.

24:59.206 --> 25:02.292
Soon, they'll post it online
and leave a bunch of unpleasant comments.

25:03.376 --> 25:05.587
"I saw NJ today,
and she wasn't as pretty as I thought."

25:06.171 --> 25:09.174
"Also she didn't let me take a photo."
"Got a nasty temper too."

25:10.717 --> 25:12.511
All coming from complete strangers,

25:13.011 --> 25:14.846
but for some reason,
they think they know me

25:14.930 --> 25:16.306
and have the right to judge me.

25:18.850 --> 25:20.060
Isn't that funny?

25:21.770 --> 25:24.272
Jeez, I should've checked their phone
if they took a picture.

25:24.356 --> 25:25.941
That was way too rude.

25:26.024 --> 25:29.277
Never got why people refuse
to just understand.

25:29.361 --> 25:31.488
And are so quick to judge,
like you're nothing.

25:39.037 --> 25:41.498
Well, don't expect them to understand.

25:44.417 --> 25:46.628
Besides, you don't even need
their understanding.

25:47.170 --> 25:50.048
Who cares? Let them do what they want,

25:50.131 --> 25:52.217
believe whatever they wanna believe.

25:52.926 --> 25:55.220
What matters is
you understand yourself.

25:56.346 --> 25:57.764
And even that's hard.

26:03.019 --> 26:05.230
Do you wanna know one of your main charms?

26:05.313 --> 26:06.606
Oh, we're back there, huh?

26:06.690 --> 26:09.859
You're easy-going, carefree,
self-aware and not to mention, funny,

26:09.943 --> 26:13.029
so I can go on and on
about the most ridiculous things.

26:13.113 --> 26:15.448
- Is that a compliment?
- But also,

26:15.532 --> 26:18.952
you have this serious and sincere side
to you that feels so reassuring.

26:19.452 --> 26:22.163
You tell me what I need to hear
without even trying.

26:23.707 --> 26:26.501
You're quite charming.
And that's on both sides.

26:28.670 --> 26:31.214
I wasn't confessing my love.
What are you all shy for?

26:32.132 --> 26:34.801
It's just, well, I've never
been good with compliments.

26:34.884 --> 26:37.971
Look at that. You're also adorable.

26:38.888 --> 26:40.974
Come on, what do you think
we should we do next?

26:41.057 --> 26:43.852
I haven't had a free day in ages.
What do we do first?

26:43.935 --> 26:46.605
Hmm. Let's see…

26:47.981 --> 26:49.316
Uh…

26:49.399 --> 26:52.068
He was never the type to just
easily make friends with new people.

26:52.152 --> 26:53.278
He's not naturally sociable.

26:53.361 --> 26:55.196
Which makes him shy away
from any sort of contact.

26:55.280 --> 26:57.949
Always just interested in himself,
like some egomaniac.

26:58.033 --> 27:01.786
I mean, he's probably just interested
in her because she's a famous celebrity.

27:01.870 --> 27:05.206
And since he's become famous lately,
I guess he's enjoying all this.

27:05.290 --> 27:07.834
If you ask me, he should have never
revealed himself to the public.

27:07.917 --> 27:11.087
Why'd he do that? Deep down,
he was just looking for attention.

27:11.171 --> 27:13.715
But weren't you the one
who convinced him to do all of that?

27:14.299 --> 27:15.842
Exactly, why'd he need convincing?

27:20.013 --> 27:21.097
What?

27:21.598 --> 27:24.225
You've been talking non-stop
about him for five blocks now.

27:25.602 --> 27:28.688
What should we get? You craving anything?

27:28.772 --> 27:31.107
That was a terrible shift.
You need to work on that a bit.

27:31.191 --> 27:32.817
How about some traditional cuisine?

27:35.362 --> 27:37.572
- Oh? How are you doing?
- Oh, hey, Dad!

27:37.656 --> 27:39.157
Hey, you guys.

27:39.240 --> 27:41.951
What's all this stuff you ordered?
It's like double the usual amount.

27:42.035 --> 27:44.079
We've been getting
a lot more customers lately.

27:44.162 --> 27:46.039
- Let me.
- It's fine.

27:46.122 --> 27:48.625
Oh, Dad, your back's gonna
give out real soon.

27:48.708 --> 27:50.877
My back's just fine, don't you worry.

27:50.960 --> 27:52.629
Where's Ung been lately?
What's he been up to?

27:52.712 --> 27:54.631
That little rascal hasn't been picking up,
and I'm getting annoyed.

27:54.714 --> 27:56.841
Do you want me to tell him
to come over right now?

27:56.925 --> 27:58.385
- It's fine.
- Yeon-su, you're here.

27:58.468 --> 27:59.803
Oh, hello there.

27:59.886 --> 28:01.971
I can't believe
you called Ji-ung to help us.

28:02.055 --> 28:04.099
What? Did I call you guys?
Tell this woman I didn't do it.

28:04.182 --> 28:05.767
We just stopped by for a little.
It won't take long.

28:05.850 --> 28:08.436
Oh, Ji-ung,
you're such a wonderful person.

28:08.520 --> 28:10.355
- Thank you very much.
- You're welcome.

28:10.438 --> 28:11.856
- No.
- It's okay, Yeon-su.

28:11.940 --> 28:14.317
They're really heavy. Don't.
Just stop. Have you eaten?

28:14.401 --> 28:16.111
Not yet. We were actually
just about to eat.

28:16.194 --> 28:18.238
What a coincidence, eat here.

28:18.321 --> 28:21.741
Oh, my goodness. Aren't you Ji-ung's mom?

28:21.825 --> 28:24.327
Oh, I haven't seen you
in such a long time.

28:24.411 --> 28:26.371
My goodness. How have you been?

28:26.454 --> 28:28.248
I hadn't seen you in ages,
so I was starting to get worried.

28:28.331 --> 28:30.625
- Have you been doing well?
- You're looking good.

28:30.709 --> 28:32.585
Oh, you must have
been grocery shopping.

28:32.669 --> 28:35.004
- Come inside if you haven't eaten.
- Come inside.

28:35.088 --> 28:36.631
- Yeon-su.
- Yeah?

28:36.715 --> 28:39.092
I'm sorry, but I don't think
I can eat with you.

28:39.175 --> 28:40.844
You should stay with them and eat here.

28:42.262 --> 28:44.639
- So how have you been?
- Yeah, what have you been up to?

28:45.140 --> 28:48.351
- Oh. Ji-ung, aren't you going to eat?
- No.

28:48.435 --> 28:49.477
All right.

28:49.561 --> 28:50.562
Goodbye.

28:50.645 --> 28:52.230
- Goodbye.
- Take care.

28:52.313 --> 28:54.482
- He should have just eaten here.
- See you.

29:00.613 --> 29:02.031
Something you need to say?

29:04.993 --> 29:06.828
You should at least sleep at home.

29:06.911 --> 29:08.913
That way you're comfortable.

29:11.541 --> 29:13.460
Or if you want, I can leave.

29:14.043 --> 29:15.754
Either way, you're gonna leave anyway.

29:22.552 --> 29:23.887
Can you do me a favor?

29:25.847 --> 29:28.433
I really care about
all those people back there,

29:29.976 --> 29:32.395
so I don't want them
to ever see this side of me.

29:35.940 --> 29:37.233
Be your usual self.

29:39.152 --> 29:40.737
Ignore them and be on your way.

29:58.922 --> 30:01.508
Again, I'm seeing
a totally new side of you.

30:02.342 --> 30:04.469
- Huh?
- You didn't strike me as the type of guy

30:04.552 --> 30:06.679
who owned a car
or even knew how to drive one.

30:06.763 --> 30:10.350
- Hmm. I like this.
- What? Oh, I thought you meant…

30:10.433 --> 30:11.893
Well, be more specific, Ung.

30:14.312 --> 30:17.482
Oh! Sorry. I didn't mean like…

30:17.565 --> 30:20.401
this, as in us, I meant driving.

30:20.485 --> 30:22.612
It's just that Eun-ho usually drives,

30:22.695 --> 30:26.866
and I rarely have to travel far anyway.
I'm not outdoorsy.

30:27.492 --> 30:30.203
I really wanted us to have a blast today.

30:30.286 --> 30:32.747
I'm sorry we kept
running away from everyone.

30:32.831 --> 30:35.291
It's fascinating, everyone recognizes you.

30:35.875 --> 30:37.961
So what do you like to do
when you're all by yourself?

30:38.044 --> 30:40.672
Hmm… When I'm by myself?

30:40.755 --> 30:43.383
Well, I enjoy just doing nothing.

30:43.466 --> 30:44.926
Then what did you do yesterday?

30:46.636 --> 30:47.595
Uh…

30:48.805 --> 30:49.806
I was…

30:55.436 --> 30:57.939
I really don't want to be
this kind of girl,

30:58.940 --> 31:00.859
but can I ask you something personal?

31:03.194 --> 31:04.988
What's your relationship with Ms. Kook?

31:07.740 --> 31:08.575
Uh…

31:08.658 --> 31:11.244
Like back then or right now?

31:12.453 --> 31:13.538
Either.

31:15.498 --> 31:16.541
Well, back then…

31:17.834 --> 31:19.335
I really liked her.

31:20.587 --> 31:23.339
I didn't know I could be
that madly in love.

31:26.092 --> 31:27.927
Mm… But now…

31:30.722 --> 31:32.098
well, we're just friends.

31:33.057 --> 31:36.311
Tell me, how does it feel
to love someone as much as you loved her?

31:37.103 --> 31:38.187
I'm very curious.

31:38.688 --> 31:41.941
Like how could you still talk about her
like that without breaking down

31:42.025 --> 31:43.526
even though you two are over?

31:45.445 --> 31:47.447
Actually, no, don't.

31:47.530 --> 31:49.824
Forget about that question.
I'm not curious anymore.

31:52.619 --> 31:54.579
Oh, sorry,
I think we're getting close now.

31:54.662 --> 31:56.998
Yeah, we are. Turn left over there.

32:12.221 --> 32:13.932
Thank you very much for dropping me off.

32:14.599 --> 32:16.225
- You take care.
- I will.

32:16.309 --> 32:17.810
Wait.

32:17.894 --> 32:21.606
You shouldn't try to put
too much meaning into what happened today.

32:22.231 --> 32:23.316
Just get some rest.

32:26.819 --> 32:27.946
Hold on a sec.

32:28.613 --> 32:32.241
I just thought it'd be a shame
to end my super rare free day like this.

32:32.325 --> 32:35.370
- But there's nowhere we can even--
- Do you wanna come up?

32:55.390 --> 32:58.017
I'm not saying this
because it's bothering me or anything.

32:58.643 --> 33:00.853
I'm just curious, which is a normal thing.

33:00.937 --> 33:03.106
Just what are those two up to?

33:04.691 --> 33:06.234
As if they're actually friends.

33:06.317 --> 33:08.861
Were they even schoolmates,
colleagues or neighbors at least.

33:08.945 --> 33:10.196
How can they be friends

33:10.279 --> 33:12.448
when they don't even have
any shared memories together?

33:15.827 --> 33:17.537
They can't still be together, right?

33:18.287 --> 33:20.206
Because if he had lunch outside then,

33:20.289 --> 33:22.625
wouldn't it make sense
to just have dinner at home?

33:25.503 --> 33:27.296
God, that's cold!

33:27.380 --> 33:29.424
- Oh.
- What are you trying to do to me?

33:29.507 --> 33:31.843
- Oh, my goodness.
- Oh, do you have a blindfold on?

33:31.926 --> 33:33.803
Are you trying to do it on purpose?

33:33.886 --> 33:36.014
It's okay.
It wasn't that much, just relax.

33:36.097 --> 33:39.726
What do you mean? It's all over there.
I feel like I'm being drenched here.

33:39.809 --> 33:40.685
You're not.

33:40.768 --> 33:42.687
Will you please just concentrate
some more?

33:42.770 --> 33:45.690
It's 'cause you were dozing off, grandma.
Stop deflecting, it's bad.

33:45.773 --> 33:47.400
Lift up your head a bit more. Hmm?

33:51.696 --> 33:53.906
Oh, my God, what the hell just happened?

33:54.907 --> 33:56.284
Listen, NJ.

33:57.452 --> 33:59.162
I think I should just go home now.

34:00.955 --> 34:01.873
Okay.

34:01.956 --> 34:04.375
Did you really have to get out of the car
just so you could reject me?

34:04.959 --> 34:07.003
Well, I had to,
since you were asking so politely.

34:07.086 --> 34:08.671
Hold on a sec. You got it all wrong.

34:08.755 --> 34:11.799
Don't overthink this. It was just
a thought that crossed my mind.

34:11.883 --> 34:14.635
You took it way too seriously
by overreacting,

34:14.719 --> 34:16.179
and now I feel embarrassed.

34:16.262 --> 34:18.014
Okay, I'm sorry.

34:18.097 --> 34:20.683
I said that wasn't necessary.
You're still overreacting.

34:20.767 --> 34:22.560
You know how ridiculous
you're being right now?

34:22.643 --> 34:24.604
I wasn't asking you
to date me or anything.

34:24.687 --> 34:26.939
I didn't wanna say goodbye yet,
so I thought we could go up

34:27.023 --> 34:29.067
and chat in a nice private place.

34:29.150 --> 34:30.485
This is how I am.

34:30.568 --> 34:32.403
It takes time to warm up to someone.

34:32.487 --> 34:33.946
I mean,

34:34.030 --> 34:36.908
for God's sake, it's already been a month.
How much slower do we need to go?

34:37.909 --> 34:40.369
He's going to stay
as my crush forever at this rate.

34:46.417 --> 34:47.585
Well…

34:48.961 --> 34:52.173
Having a crush
isn't such a bad thing actually.

34:54.217 --> 34:57.428
I can wait. I can wait.

34:58.054 --> 34:58.971
#NJ
1.81 MILLION POSTS

34:59.055 --> 35:01.432
APDLW_J
548 LIKES

35:01.516 --> 35:03.351
I saw the famous NJ today.

35:03.434 --> 35:05.561
I asked her for a photo,
and then she downright ignored me.

35:05.645 --> 35:06.938
She does have an awful temper.

35:07.021 --> 35:09.982
And is she really that pretty?
Oh, I beg to differ.

35:10.066 --> 35:11.526
NJ has an awful personality.

35:11.609 --> 35:13.402
How hard is it to agree?

35:14.737 --> 35:16.239
It's your job
to have your photo taken.

35:21.994 --> 35:24.080
I… I left something at your place.

35:24.163 --> 35:26.165
I need to go and get it right now,
if that's okay.

35:27.792 --> 35:30.294
It's something I need.
It's super precious to me.

35:47.812 --> 35:49.438
Technically as a friend,

35:49.522 --> 35:52.150
it wouldn't be too weird
if I asked him what he's up to.

35:55.486 --> 35:58.698
Don't hide it. That's what
having a secret crush feels like.

36:00.616 --> 36:02.034
That's not true.

36:02.118 --> 36:03.536
Are you almost done?

36:11.210 --> 36:14.922
This isn't like…
I mean, I don't have a crush on him.

36:16.591 --> 36:18.342
Hmm? What is this?

36:18.968 --> 36:22.054
What the… What are you…
What is all this? Huh?

36:23.306 --> 36:25.349
It looks like green sausages in there.

36:25.433 --> 36:28.019
Who puts zucchini this big
into their soup, hm?

36:28.728 --> 36:30.354
What in the world is the matter with you?

36:31.230 --> 36:34.317
I bet this… What have you done?

37:09.268 --> 37:10.519
This is really bad.

37:13.940 --> 37:15.274
I guess I was wrong.

37:19.278 --> 37:21.239
I still have feelings for him.

37:33.417 --> 37:34.627
This yours?

37:36.379 --> 37:38.089
Yeah, it is.

37:40.591 --> 37:43.094
Was this
that super precious pouch of yours?

37:44.512 --> 37:46.055
Is this why you came here?

37:48.182 --> 37:51.560
Yeah, well, you said
it was really precious to you.

37:54.355 --> 37:55.690
And is that all?

37:58.359 --> 37:59.819
I can't deny it.

38:03.614 --> 38:04.991
I don't think that…

38:07.285 --> 38:10.246
I ever forgot about him,
even for a second.

38:21.299 --> 38:22.633
You know what?

38:26.929 --> 38:28.139
I…

38:29.098 --> 38:30.433
I think that…

38:30.516 --> 38:32.268
Who is that out there?

39:00.629 --> 39:02.882
You know that I haven't seen you in years.

39:03.758 --> 39:05.634
So why did you suddenly show up?

39:06.260 --> 39:07.386
Grandma.

39:07.970 --> 39:09.847
You're the one who invited him inside.

39:09.930 --> 39:13.684
Because he said he hadn't eaten yet.
Of course I should feed him.

39:14.894 --> 39:17.229
What are you doing? Eat up. Go.

39:20.775 --> 39:23.652
All right. Be straight.
Are you two dating again?

39:25.404 --> 39:29.200
Grandma, what?
Just let him eat in peace, will you?

39:29.283 --> 39:31.619
Also, it's not like that.
We're just friends.

39:31.702 --> 39:33.954
"We're just friends", my foot.

39:34.038 --> 39:35.790
Were you that desperate to have a friend?

39:38.459 --> 39:40.294
What's wrong with you? Eat up.

39:40.378 --> 39:41.420
Oh. Yeah.

39:41.504 --> 39:43.923
Look at him nibbling on like a rat.

39:44.006 --> 39:46.675
- Is it bad?
- Oh, it's delicious.

39:46.759 --> 39:49.637
Hey. Slow it down. You don't wanna choke.

39:49.720 --> 39:53.349
You gotta be rock bottom desperate
to be friends with your ex.

39:54.225 --> 39:56.435
That other boy is
a whole lot better. Ji-ung.

39:57.395 --> 40:01.649
He's got good manners, he's well-behaved,
looks respectable and cute too.

40:02.483 --> 40:06.112
On the other hand, look at this guy.
He's a useless sack of potatoes.

40:07.696 --> 40:09.073
Hey, I'm sorry.

40:09.156 --> 40:12.535
She hasn't changed. You know
she likes to badmouth people openly.

40:15.037 --> 40:17.665
Are you even able to eat well, at least?

40:17.748 --> 40:20.167
Looks like you got a lot skinnier now.

40:21.043 --> 40:25.548
So tell me. Do you even have
a decent job to support yourself?

40:25.631 --> 40:26.590
Hmm…

40:28.592 --> 40:31.011
I asked you a question, answer!

40:31.095 --> 40:34.140
Still just as reserved and shy
as if he never grew a spine.

40:34.223 --> 40:37.476
Grandma, quit it. Stop scolding him.
He's trying to eat, like you asked him.

40:37.560 --> 40:40.646
What's wrong? Why are you being
so cold towards him all of a sudden?

40:40.729 --> 40:43.107
You want me to be kind
to someone who made you cry?

40:44.191 --> 40:45.901
I'd love to beat his ass up.

41:03.544 --> 41:06.422
Hey. You don't have to do this. Just go.

41:07.631 --> 41:10.217
I know you're uncomfortable.
You should go.

41:10.301 --> 41:12.636
I wanna apologize for her behavior.

41:13.387 --> 41:15.097
I should still eat anyway.

41:31.197 --> 41:34.450
You're just eating plain rice.
Don't skip the side dishes.

41:34.533 --> 41:35.784
Thank you.

41:49.507 --> 41:51.425
God, look at this belly.

41:51.509 --> 41:52.760
You think it's a boy or a girl?

41:53.344 --> 41:56.055
You know, you shouldn't have overeaten.
Why did you have two extra bowls?

41:56.138 --> 41:58.057
She gave me more soup if I had rice left

41:58.140 --> 42:00.309
and gave me more rice if I had soup left.
I had no choice.

42:01.101 --> 42:02.853
I haven't eaten this much in a while.

42:04.146 --> 42:06.232
She's still the same, your grandma.

42:06.899 --> 42:08.734
And still scary as ever.

42:19.245 --> 42:20.329
Later.

42:21.622 --> 42:22.665
Hmm.

42:27.002 --> 42:27.962
Hey, Ung.

42:30.631 --> 42:31.632
I…

42:33.676 --> 42:34.677
Thank you.

42:36.470 --> 42:37.763
For what?

42:40.683 --> 42:41.850
Uh…

42:44.103 --> 42:46.730
For my pouch, thanks for bringing it back.

42:49.149 --> 42:50.067
See that?

42:51.527 --> 42:53.904
I guess we can really
be friends after all, right?

43:16.760 --> 43:18.596
Grandma, just let me do it.

43:19.638 --> 43:20.556
Okay.

43:22.516 --> 43:24.059
Did he leave yet?

43:24.643 --> 43:25.561
Yes.

43:27.438 --> 43:29.940
Hmm. Could have stayed longer.

43:30.024 --> 43:31.066
Why didn't he?

43:31.150 --> 43:34.445
You really expected him to stay
after giving him an earful?

43:35.029 --> 43:37.323
Besides, I thought you wanted him gone.

43:37.406 --> 43:39.408
Now, why would you assume that?

43:40.492 --> 43:43.037
But it is true that
he gave you a hard time.

43:45.372 --> 43:47.082
So when did you see me cry?

43:47.166 --> 43:50.586
Oh, please, you were secretly crying
for days on end. I was so worried.

43:50.669 --> 43:52.379
You expected me not to notice that?

43:53.631 --> 43:56.091
Just thinking about it
makes my blood boil.

43:56.175 --> 43:58.177
That good for nothing scumbag.

43:58.260 --> 44:00.888
In fact, I should have been
a whole lot harsher than that.

44:31.418 --> 44:33.128
I was the one who broke up with him.

44:36.006 --> 44:38.008
I pretty much abandoned him.

44:40.260 --> 44:41.261
Hmm?

44:45.683 --> 44:47.309
It was basically my fault.

44:49.520 --> 44:50.896
I was being selfish.

44:52.731 --> 44:54.316
But, Yeon-su…

44:55.984 --> 44:57.236
And grandma…

44:59.947 --> 45:02.199
I still have feelings for Choi Ung.

45:05.452 --> 45:06.912
Despite I abandoning him…

45:07.746 --> 45:08.956
and letting him go,

45:10.541 --> 45:11.625
I still…

45:12.876 --> 45:14.920
He never left my heart at all.

45:18.048 --> 45:19.174
So that's why…

45:20.259 --> 45:22.428
you ought to be shouting at me instead.

45:24.847 --> 45:27.015
Tell me that I was being stupid and cruel.

45:28.225 --> 45:29.560
Because I deserve it.

45:31.103 --> 45:34.106
Ask me why I would do something
that I'd regret later on.

45:36.108 --> 45:37.192
So, please…

45:38.360 --> 45:39.403
Just say something.

45:40.946 --> 45:42.072
Yeon-su…

45:44.283 --> 45:46.201
What should I do, grandma?

45:50.664 --> 45:53.000
'Cause I can't handle being just friends.

45:54.710 --> 45:55.586
I can't.

45:58.130 --> 46:00.841
But I guess for him it's a lot easier.

46:02.885 --> 46:05.345
I have no idea what I should do.

46:17.232 --> 46:18.901
Oh, my poor girl.

47:00.025 --> 47:01.693
BEFORE OUR SUMMER

47:25.634 --> 47:29.054
Look at Ms. Kook.
Her eyes are swollen like crazy.

47:30.138 --> 47:31.390
Speaking from experience,

47:31.473 --> 47:34.351
she probably cried all night
for at least five hours minimum.

47:36.395 --> 47:39.356
I'm so exhausted. I really am. Going home.

47:39.940 --> 47:42.484
Ugh, it's such a lazy afternoon,
what's going on?

47:42.568 --> 47:45.612
We should probably have some coffee
to help us stay awake, right? You in?

47:45.696 --> 47:46.947
- Coffee sounds great.
- You all in?

47:47.030 --> 47:48.991
How about we play Ghost Leg
to spice it up?

47:49.074 --> 47:50.450
- Yeah? Okay?
- Uh-huh.

47:50.534 --> 47:53.287
Ji-un, let's go. Get everything ready.
Okay. Go.

47:55.414 --> 47:56.248
Ms. Kook.

48:01.128 --> 48:02.880
Wow, have you guys seen her eyes?

48:02.963 --> 48:04.590
What's wrong?

48:04.673 --> 48:07.509
Did you notice
what her eyes look like today? Wow.

48:08.218 --> 48:09.052
Wow.

48:09.720 --> 48:11.430
You look a little different than usual.

48:12.764 --> 48:15.058
A carp. She looks like a carp fish.

48:15.809 --> 48:17.853
What's the matter?
Did you cry last night or something?

48:17.936 --> 48:20.230
'Cause if that's not it,
then how could you look like this?

48:20.314 --> 48:22.065
No, I didn't cry.

48:23.567 --> 48:25.110
I got a sty on my eye.

48:26.194 --> 48:28.238
- Huh?
- I said that it's…

48:29.323 --> 48:31.533
a sty, sir.

48:36.830 --> 48:38.540
It's a sty, guys.

48:38.624 --> 48:40.792
- It's a sty.
- I knew it.

48:40.876 --> 48:42.753
It's a sty. I told you
from the beginning, right?

48:43.378 --> 48:44.546
Anyway, since she has a sty,

48:44.630 --> 48:46.882
I say we all focus
and do a good job. Let's go.

48:46.965 --> 48:48.634
- All right. Yes, sir.
- Okay, good.

48:48.717 --> 48:50.010
- The Ghost Leg?
- Pass.

48:50.093 --> 48:51.720
Stick with what you're doing.

49:11.198 --> 49:13.408
Well, well, what brings you here?

49:13.492 --> 49:16.078
What's the matter?
Couldn't handle all the adoring fans?

49:16.870 --> 49:19.247
No reason. It just felt weird
to be all alone at home.

49:19.331 --> 49:21.792
You've always been alone
in that big old house.

49:21.875 --> 49:23.961
So why did you even move out
in the first place?

49:24.044 --> 49:25.379
I told you to just move back in.

49:25.462 --> 49:29.091
Jeez. No matter how hard you try,
it won't work. I won't be swayed.

49:30.175 --> 49:31.551
Then what if it's me?

49:32.135 --> 49:33.387
Then I could be swayed a bit.

49:34.680 --> 49:36.974
Wow, you treacherous little punk.

49:37.057 --> 49:39.101
You don't deserve to sit on my bench.
So move your butt.

49:39.184 --> 49:40.811
No, you move your butt.

49:40.894 --> 49:43.313
Suit yourself, you little traitor.

49:44.147 --> 49:45.148
- Hey, Ung.
- Hmm?

49:45.232 --> 49:48.151
Call Ji-ung right now and ask him
if he plans to have dinner somewhere.

49:48.235 --> 49:50.612
If not, tell him to come here instead.
I made lots of food.

49:51.196 --> 49:53.281
Well, I spoke to him earlier,
he said he was gonna be working late.

49:53.365 --> 49:56.159
You know he's always pretending
to be busy and stuff. It's annoying.

49:56.243 --> 49:58.036
Really?
Oh, that's not good at all.

49:58.120 --> 50:00.122
That boy needs to have
at least a proper meal today.

50:00.205 --> 50:03.375
Oh, you know what? I'll just pick
one of each and pack his dinner.

50:03.458 --> 50:05.627
Can you drop it off later to him?

50:05.711 --> 50:08.255
Just call a delivery service.
I'll even pay for it.

50:08.338 --> 50:11.299
Not a chance. Don't be ridiculous.
Not like you're doing anything anyway.

50:11.383 --> 50:13.343
I can't be bothered.

50:13.427 --> 50:15.095
How about you tell him
to come late and eat?

50:15.178 --> 50:17.597
No, not today. Hurry up and get ready.

50:19.016 --> 50:20.183
Man.

50:30.694 --> 50:32.529
You should sleep at home tonight.

50:33.113 --> 50:34.573
Don't worry, I'm not there anymore.

50:40.954 --> 50:42.789
Ji-ung, are you going to the editing room?

50:45.542 --> 50:46.376
Ji-ung.

50:48.086 --> 50:49.963
- Huh?
- Are you editing right now?

50:51.548 --> 50:52.591
Oh. Yeah.

50:53.592 --> 50:56.136
Oh. Yeah, right. Can you leave this there?
I need to go now.

50:56.219 --> 50:58.513
I'm gonna go home and wash up,
and change clothes.

50:58.597 --> 51:00.348
Ji-ung, did you
spend the night here again?

51:00.432 --> 51:01.558
Yeah.

51:02.768 --> 51:04.770
Please do that for me. I'll be back.

52:29.813 --> 52:31.148
Look who's here!

52:31.231 --> 52:33.942
- Ung!
- Oh, Mr. Park.

52:34.025 --> 52:36.278
Wow. Look at you, huh?

52:36.361 --> 52:39.030
You haven't changed one bit,
you little rascal!

52:39.114 --> 52:41.867
I saw the footage of you so far,
and you really hadn't changed at all.

52:41.950 --> 52:44.327
You still look like a flipping student.

52:44.411 --> 52:46.788
Same with you. You still look like
you're in your thirties.

52:47.414 --> 52:48.623
I am in my thirties.

52:50.625 --> 52:52.419
Exactly. You look like it.

52:52.502 --> 52:53.753
Huh.

52:55.797 --> 52:57.549
What are you doing here?
Are you visiting Ji-ung?

52:57.632 --> 52:59.050
Oh, do you know where he is?

52:59.134 --> 53:01.928
Ah, him and Chae-ran are practically
living in the editing room these days.

53:02.512 --> 53:03.972
- Follow me. I'll take you there.
- Oh. Okay.

53:04.055 --> 53:07.058
Wow, dude. Made a name for yourself, huh?

53:07.142 --> 53:09.728
You know, even though you had
the lowest grades in school,

53:09.811 --> 53:11.771
I saw your potential,
your drawings said it all.

53:11.855 --> 53:13.148
I just knew you'd make it.

53:13.231 --> 53:16.359
- My God. How are your parents doing?
- They're well.

53:16.860 --> 53:19.279
Chae-ran! Where'd Ji-ung go?

53:19.362 --> 53:22.866
Uh, he just left so he can stop
by his house to change and stuff.

53:22.949 --> 53:24.618
Oh, is that so. Is he coming back?

53:25.202 --> 53:27.787
Uh, he said it won't take long.
Just a quick house run.

53:27.871 --> 53:30.123
- He'll be back soon.
- Oh, okay.

53:30.207 --> 53:33.335
Hey, Ung, you just wait here.
Ji-ung will be back soon.

53:33.418 --> 53:34.419
- Okay.
- Good.

53:34.502 --> 53:36.338
Chae-ran, out. Come out. Come here.

53:36.421 --> 53:37.881
- I have something to tell you. Quick.
- Okay.

53:42.802 --> 53:44.512
Oh, boy.

53:47.098 --> 53:48.308
Huh?

53:55.065 --> 53:56.816
What do I need to press here?

54:09.246 --> 54:12.832
Exactly how slow do I need to be for you?

54:12.916 --> 54:14.376
MR. CHOI UNG

54:15.293 --> 54:17.170
Should I call or not?

54:24.594 --> 54:26.012
Good evening.

54:27.347 --> 54:28.390
Excuse me?

54:30.976 --> 54:32.269
Okay. Fine, I'll check.

54:37.023 --> 54:38.817
Please pick up for once.

54:43.280 --> 54:45.198
I can't believe my eyes are still red.

54:46.533 --> 54:48.451
I'm never going to cry again.

54:58.128 --> 55:00.463
- What is it?
- Working late?

55:01.631 --> 55:03.591
No, I clocked out.

55:03.675 --> 55:06.094
Well… Are you okay?

55:06.177 --> 55:07.178
With what?

55:08.013 --> 55:09.597
Haven't you seen the news yet?

55:11.016 --> 55:11.933
About what?

55:12.017 --> 55:15.312
About NJ's latest dating rumor.

55:15.395 --> 55:16.604
Ji-ung?

55:16.688 --> 55:18.023
The thing is…

55:18.106 --> 55:19.691
- Wait, hold on.
- Choi--

55:20.483 --> 55:22.027
What brings you out here?

55:23.320 --> 55:24.779
Going home now?

55:27.073 --> 55:28.491
You must have clocked out early.

55:31.578 --> 55:33.163
Oh. Uh…

55:33.997 --> 55:37.292
Actually, I'm rushing so I should
get going now. Have a good night.

55:45.467 --> 55:48.470
Hey. Is something going on?

55:52.474 --> 55:53.391
Yeon-su.

55:55.185 --> 55:56.061
Hmm?

55:57.270 --> 55:58.480
Today is my birthday.

55:59.856 --> 56:01.858
Oh, really?

56:02.484 --> 56:03.318
Happy birthday.

56:03.401 --> 56:06.488
If I had known sooner, I would have
treated you to a fancy meal or something.

56:08.073 --> 56:10.533
My mom came by
and prepared a birthday meal for me.

56:11.951 --> 56:13.745
She's the woman I saw before, right?

56:14.871 --> 56:17.791
That was my first time seeing her.
She's a beautiful woman.

56:21.086 --> 56:22.504
She still doesn't know…

56:25.840 --> 56:28.176
She still doesn't know
that I'm allergic to peaches.

56:34.015 --> 56:35.183
One time…

56:37.769 --> 56:38.937
I almost died…

56:42.107 --> 56:44.859
and this was right in front of her
after eating a peach.

56:46.236 --> 56:48.196
But I guess she still doesn't know.

56:50.156 --> 56:52.534
Hey. Hey, Ji-ung…

56:59.124 --> 57:01.459
Are… are you okay?

57:04.087 --> 57:05.755
Or maybe she never really cared.

57:33.908 --> 57:36.035
CURRENT AFFAIRS AND CULTURE
KIM JI-UNG

57:41.040 --> 57:44.669
EPILOGUE
NOVEMBER, 2010

57:54.471 --> 57:56.097
What are you, frozen?

57:57.974 --> 58:00.101
Hey, can I sleep over at your house today?

58:01.144 --> 58:02.228
Sure, of course you can.

58:23.374 --> 58:24.876
How is that even possible?

58:29.339 --> 58:31.341
What do you think about that?

58:31.424 --> 58:32.509
That's crazy.

58:34.344 --> 58:35.386
I know.

58:35.470 --> 58:36.429
- Sleepy?
- No.

58:49.234 --> 58:52.403
THE PREVIOUS NIGHT

58:54.489 --> 58:55.907
Aren't you working?

58:55.990 --> 58:57.992
Oh, my God.

59:02.622 --> 59:03.831
So tell me.

59:04.791 --> 59:05.667
What?

59:05.750 --> 59:07.794
I'm all ears, so spill it. Come on.

59:14.133 --> 59:15.593
My mom came by.

59:23.017 --> 59:25.019
She came unannounced just like before.

59:28.273 --> 59:31.859
Judging by the size of her suitcase,
I think she'll be here for about a week.

59:33.945 --> 59:35.905
She'll act as if
she'll be staying with me.

59:37.574 --> 59:39.784
And then she'll vanish once again.

59:41.202 --> 59:44.038
How many times has she done this?

59:46.040 --> 59:48.418
You know, she even
made breakfast this morning somehow.

59:48.501 --> 59:49.544
Terrible cook.

59:55.592 --> 01:00:02.599
HELLO, MY SOULMATE

01:00:25.455 --> 01:00:28.041
Yeah, she's pretty,
but she's not Ung's type.

01:00:28.625 --> 01:00:30.293
What's the probability
of your ex ending up

01:00:30.376 --> 01:00:33.212
in a scandal with a celebrity
in your lifetime?

01:00:33.796 --> 01:00:35.298
Someone once told me

01:00:35.381 --> 01:00:37.884
that everything I shoot
is full of emotion.

01:00:38.968 --> 01:00:42.138
Ung, about us being just friends…

01:00:42.221 --> 01:00:44.057
I don't think I can do that.

01:00:44.140 --> 01:00:45.516
You're drunk.

01:00:45.600 --> 01:00:49.354
I don't think I can face something
that I can't handle again.

01:00:51.189 --> 01:00:52.231
Are you and Ung…

01:00:53.107 --> 01:00:54.984
What you read in the article is true.

01:00:55.068 --> 01:00:57.278
Ung and I are dating.
